<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>{{ document.report_id }} — {{ document.title }}</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    html, body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#777; color:#202020; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; }
    .page { width:816px; height:1056px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; background:#f8f7f2; break-after:page; page-break-after:always; }
    .page:nth-child(3n+2) { filter:contrast(.98); }
    .page::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none; opacity:.09; background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 3px,#666 4px); mix-blend-mode:multiply; }
    .header { position:absolute; left:56px; right:48px; top:34px; height:66px; border-top:5px solid #303030; border-bottom:1px solid #555; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
    .brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; }
    .brand img { max-width:116px; max-height:34px; filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.3); }
    .brand span { border-left:1px solid #777; padding-left:12px; font-size:10px; font-weight:bold; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .docmeta { text-align:right; font:9px/1.4 "Courier New",monospace; }
    .content { position:absolute; left:56px; right:48px; top:124px; bottom:58px; }
    .footer { position:absolute; left:56px; right:48px; bottom:25px; border-top:1px solid #777; padding-top:5px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font:8px "Courier New",monospace; }
    .fictional { font-weight:bold; }
    h1 { margin:0 0 12px; font:700 30px/1.05 Georgia,serif; }
    h2 { margin:0 0 12px; font:700 21px/1.1 Georgia,serif; border-bottom:2px solid #333; padding-bottom:5px; }
    h3 { margin:0 0 6px; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; }
    p, li { margin-top:0; font-size:10px; line-height:1.38; }
    ul, ol { margin-top:5px; padding-left:18px; }
    li { margin-bottom:5px; }
    .kicker { font:700 9px "Courier New",monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px; margin-bottom:8px; }
    .cover-box { border:3px double #222; padding:24px; margin-top:40px; }
    .cover-class { margin-top:20px; padding:9px; border:2px solid #222; font:bold 10px "Courier New",monospace; text-align:center; }
    .stamp { position:absolute; right:65px; top:465px; border:4px double #842a2a; color:#842a2a; padding:14px 18px; font:bold 20px "Courier New",monospace; transform:rotate(-4deg); opacity:.8; }
    .field-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; border-top:1px solid #555; }
    .field { padding:8px 10px 8px 0; min-height:46px; border-bottom:1px solid #aaa; }
    .field:nth-child(even) { border-left:1px solid #aaa; padding-left:10px; }
    .field label { display:block; font:bold 8px "Courier New",monospace; text-transform:uppercase; color:#555; margin-bottom:3px; }
    .field div { font-size:10px; line-height:1.3; }
    .wide { grid-column:1/-1; border-left:0 !important; padding-left:0 !important; }
    .summary-band { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); border:2px solid #333; margin:15px 0; }
    .summary-band div { padding:13px; border-right:1px solid #555; text-align:center; }
    .summary-band div:last-child { border:0; }
    .summary-band b { display:block; font:700 26px Georgia,serif; }
    .note { border-left:6px solid #555; background:#e8e7e2; padding:11px 13px; margin:12px 0; }
    .two-col { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:24px; }
    .id-register { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:0 20px; border-top:2px solid #222; }
    .id-item { display:grid; grid-template-columns:42% 1fr; gap:7px; border-bottom:1px solid #aaa; padding:4px 0; }
    .id-item b { font:7px "Courier New",monospace; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .id-item span { font:7.4px "Courier New",monospace; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
    table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; table-layout:fixed; }
    th { border-top:2px solid #222; border-bottom:2px solid #222; padding:6px; text-align:left; font:bold 8px "Courier New",monospace; text-transform:uppercase; }
    td { border-bottom:1px solid #aaa; padding:6px; vertical-align:top; font-size:8.7px; line-height:1.28; }
    .system { width:22%; font-weight:bold; }
    .rating { width:18%; font:bold 8px "Courier New",monospace; }
    .deficiency { border:2px solid #333; padding:12px 14px; margin-bottom:12px; page-break-inside:avoid; }
    .def-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:start; border-bottom:1px solid #777; padding-bottom:6px; margin-bottom:7px; }
    .def-head b { font:700 12px Georgia,serif; }
    .class-major { border:2px solid #842a2a; color:#842a2a; padding:3px 8px; font:bold 9px "Courier New",monospace; }
    .class-other { border:1px solid #333; padding:3px 8px; font:bold 9px "Courier New",monospace; }
    .def-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; }
    .def-grid p { font-size:8.7px; margin-bottom:5px; }
    .capa td:nth-child(2) { width:16%; }
    .capa td:nth-child(3) { width:13%; font-family:"Courier New",monospace; }
    .signatures { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:35px; margin-top:45px; }
    .signature { border-top:1px solid #222; padding-top:7px; min-height:70px; }
    .signature b { display:block; font:700 12px Georgia,serif; }
    .attachment-title { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; border-bottom:3px double #222; padding-bottom:8px; margin-bottom:14px; }
    .attachment-title h1 { font-size:24px; margin:0; }
    .attachment-id { font:bold 10px "Courier New",monospace; }
    .figure-wrap { border:1px solid #555; padding:18px; margin-top:18px; }
    .flow { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 40px 1fr 40px 1fr; align-items:center; margin:26px 0; }
    .node { min-height:105px; border:2px solid #333; padding:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; text-align:center; }
    .node b { font:700 14px Georgia,serif; }
    .node span { font:9px/1.3 "Courier New",monospace; margin-top:5px; }
    .arrow { text-align:center; font-size:26px; }
    .risk-node { border:4px double #842a2a; position:relative; }
    .risk-node::after { content:"IDENTIFIED BREACH"; position:absolute; top:-12px; left:12px; background:#f8f7f2; color:#842a2a; padding:2px 5px; font:bold 8px "Courier New",monospace; }
    .sample-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px; margin-top:28px; }
    .sample { border-top:2px solid #333; padding-top:7px; text-align:center; }
    .sample b { display:block; font:700 11px Georgia,serif; }
    .positive { color:#842a2a; }
    .facility-map { width:100%; height:590px; display:block; border:1px solid #555; background:#eef0eb; margin-top:8px; }
    .facility-map text { fill:#202020; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; }
    .facility-map .mono { font-family:"Courier New",monospace; }
    .facility-map .zone { fill:#faf9f4; stroke:#555; stroke-width:1.2; }
    .facility-map .support { fill:#e6ebe8; stroke:#697672; stroke-width:1; }
    .facility-map .process { fill:#fff; stroke:#333; stroke-width:1.8; }
    .facility-map .risk { fill:#f4e5df; stroke:#842a2a; stroke-width:3; }
    .facility-map .hold { fill:#f3e7b8; stroke:#78631e; stroke-width:2; }
    .facility-map .control { fill:#dce9e6; stroke:#2f625a; stroke-width:1.5; }
    .facility-map .product-line { fill:none; stroke:#1f5d70; stroke-width:4; marker-end:url(#productArrow); }
    .facility-map .person-line { fill:none; stroke:#526b3c; stroke-width:2.5; stroke-dasharray:7 4; marker-end:url(#personArrow); }
    .facility-map .maintenance-line { fill:none; stroke:#8b642c; stroke-width:2.5; stroke-dasharray:2 4; marker-end:url(#maintenanceArrow); }
    .facility-map .risk-line { fill:none; stroke:#842a2a; stroke-width:4; stroke-dasharray:9 4; marker-end:url(#riskArrow); }
    .facility-map .evidence-line { fill:none; stroke:#5b556b; stroke-width:1.6; stroke-dasharray:4 3; marker-end:url(#evidenceArrow); }
    .facility-map .product-stop { fill:none; stroke:#1f5d70; stroke-width:4; }
    .facility-map .stop-bar { stroke:#842a2a; stroke-width:4; }
    .facility-map .port { fill:#fff; stroke:#333; stroke-width:1.5; }
    .facility-map .port-product { stroke:#1f5d70; }
    .facility-map .port-person { stroke:#526b3c; }
    .facility-map .port-maintenance { stroke:#8b642c; }
    .facility-map .port-risk { stroke:#842a2a; }
    .facility-map .port-evidence { stroke:#5b556b; }
    .facility-map .finding { fill:#842a2a; stroke:#fff; stroke-width:2; }
    .facility-map .finding-text { fill:#fff; font:bold 8px "Courier New",monospace; text-anchor:middle; }
    .facility-map .label { font-size:9px; }
    .facility-map .small { font-size:7.2px; }
    .facility-map .tiny { font-size:6.3px; }
    .facility-map .title { font:bold 10px Georgia,serif; }
    .map-interpretation { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-top:9px; }
    .map-interpretation p { font-size:8px; margin:0; line-height:1.28; }
    .photo { width:100%; height:590px; object-fit:cover; filter:grayscale(.25) contrast(1.08); border:1px solid #333; }
    .photo-meta { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; border:1px solid #777; margin-top:12px; }
    .photo-meta div { padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #aaa; font-size:9px; }
    .photo-meta div:nth-child(even) { border-left:1px solid #aaa; }
    .caption { margin-top:12px; border-left:5px solid #333; padding:7px 11px; font-size:10px; line-height:1.4; }
    .synthetic { font:8px/1.35 "Courier New",monospace; color:#555; margin-top:10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
{% macro chrome(page_number) -%}
  <div class="header"><div class="brand"><img src="{{ caldova_logo_uri }}" alt="Caldova"><span>Global Supplier Quality</span></div><div class="docmeta"><b>{{ document.report_id }}</b>{{ document.version }}<br>{{ document.classification }}</div></div>
  <div class="footer"><span class="fictional">{{ document.fictional_notice }}</span><span>Page {{ page_number }} of 10</span></div>
{%- endmacro %}

<section class="page">{{ chrome(1) }}<main class="content"><div class="cover-box"><div class="kicker">Supplier quality inspection</div><h1>{{ document.title }}</h1><p style="font-size:16px">{{ document.subtitle }}</p><div class="field-grid" style="margin-top:25px"><div class="field"><label>Inspected organization</label><div>{{ site.legal_name }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Site</label><div>{{ site.site_name }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Inspection dates</label><div>{{ inspection.start | date_en }} to {{ inspection.end | date_en }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Report issued</label><div>{{ document.issued | date_en }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Lead inspector</label><div>{{ inspection.lead_inspector }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Site identifier</label><div>{{ site.site_id }}</div></div><div class="field wide"><label>Triggered by</label><div>{{ references.deviation }} · {{ references.affected_run }} · {{ references.connection }}</div></div></div><div class="cover-class">{{ document.classification }}</div></div><div class="stamp">FOR CAUSE<br>FINAL</div><div class="note" style="margin-top:90px"><b>Report status.</b> This is a fictional Caldova supplier-quality inspection report created for an AI retrieval demonstration. It is not issued by WHO or any medicines regulator and makes no regulatory certification claim.</div></main></section>

<section class="page">{{ chrome(2) }}<main class="content"><div class="kicker">Part 1 · General information</div><h2>Site, inspection basis, and scope</h2><div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label>Site address</label><div>{{ site.address }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Employees</label><div>{{ site.employees }}</div></div><div class="field wide"><label>Operations</label><div>{{ site.operations }}</div></div><div class="field wide"><label>Products and campaigns in scope</label><div>{{ site.products_in_scope }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Previous Caldova audit</label><div>{{ site.previous_audit }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Inspection basis</label><div>{{ inspection.basis }}</div></div></div><h3 style="margin-top:18px">Objective</h3><p>{{ inspection.objective }}</p><div class="two-col"><div><h3>Scope</h3><ul>{% for item in inspection.scope %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div><div><h3>Inspection team</h3><ul>{% for item in inspection.inspectors %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><h3>Site representatives</h3><ul>{% for item in inspection.site_representatives %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></div><div class="note"><b>Limitations.</b> {{ inspection.limitations }}</div></main></section>

<section class="page">{{ chrome(3) }}<main class="content"><div class="kicker">Part 1 · Event and evidence</div><h2>Contamination event under inspection</h2><div class="summary-band"><div><b>{{ references.affected_run }}</b>Affected run</div><div><b>{{ references.connection }}</b>Implicated connection</div><div><b>{{ event_summary.organism }}</b>Organism</div></div><div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label>Event date</label><div>{{ event_summary.event_date | date_en }}</div></div><div class="field"><label>Detected by</label><div>{{ event_summary.detected_by }}</div></div><div class="field wide"><label>Immediate action</label><div>{{ event_summary.immediate_action }}</div></div><div class="field wide"><label>Investigation root cause</label><div>{{ event_summary.root_cause }}</div></div></div><h3 style="margin-top:18px">Evidence confirmed during inspection</h3><ol>{% for item in event_summary.evidence %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol><div class="note"><b>Commercial cross-reference.</b> {{ event_summary.financial_reference }}</div><h3>Records reviewed</h3><div class="two-col"><ul>{% for item in records_reviewed[:4] %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><ul>{% for item in records_reviewed[4:] %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div><h3 style="margin-top:10px">Linked identifiers</h3><div class="id-register">{% for label, value in references.items() %}<div class="id-item"><b>{{ label | replace('_',' ') }}</b><span>{{ value }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div></main></section>

<section class="page">{{ chrome(4) }}<main class="content"><div class="kicker">Part 2 · Inspection observations</div><h2>GMP systems assessment</h2><table><thead><tr><th class="system">System</th><th>Inspection assessment</th><th class="rating">Rating</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in system_findings %}<tr><td class="system">{{ item.system }}</td><td>{{ item.assessment }}</td><td class="rating">{{ item.rating }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><div class="note"><b>Assessment convention.</b> “Acceptable” indicates no material deficiency in the sampled evidence. “Improvement required” identifies a weakness captured in an Other deficiency or recommendation. “Deficient” maps to a formal deficiency on the following pages.</div></main></section>

<section class="page">{{ chrome(5) }}<main class="content"><div class="kicker">Part 3 · Deficiencies</div><h2>Major deficiencies</h2>{% for item in deficiencies if item.classification == 'Major' %}<section class="deficiency"><div class="def-head"><b>{{ item.id }} · {{ item.title }}</b><span class="class-major">{{ item.classification | upper }}</span></div><p>{{ item.statement }}</p><div class="def-grid"><div><p><b>Objective evidence:</b> {{ item.evidence }}</p><p><b>Potential risk:</b> {{ item.risk }}</p></div><div><p><b>Response due:</b> {{ item.due | date_en }}</p><p><b>Required response:</b> Root cause, immediate correction, systemic corrective action, accountable owner, due date, and proposed effectiveness check.</p></div></div></section>{% endfor %}<div class="note"><b>Classification basis.</b> A Major deficiency is a non-critical departure that has produced, or may produce, product not consistently meeting requirements, or a combination of departures indicating a significant systems failure. No Critical deficiency was identified in the inspected scope.</div></main></section>

<section class="page">{{ chrome(6) }}<main class="content"><div class="kicker">Part 3 · Deficiencies</div><h2>Other deficiencies and conclusion</h2>{% for item in deficiencies if item.classification == 'Other' %}<section class="deficiency"><div class="def-head"><b>{{ item.id }} · {{ item.title }}</b><span class="class-other">{{ item.classification | upper }}</span></div><p>{{ item.statement }}</p><div class="def-grid"><div><p><b>Objective evidence:</b> {{ item.evidence }}</p><p><b>Potential risk:</b> {{ item.risk }}</p></div><div><p><b>Response due:</b> {{ item.due | date_en }}</p></div></div></section>{% endfor %}<div class="summary-band"><div><b>{{ classification_summary.critical }}</b>Critical</div><div><b>{{ classification_summary.major }}</b>Major</div><div><b>{{ classification_summary.other }}</b>Other</div></div><h3>Overall conclusion</h3><p>{{ classification_summary.overall }}</p><div class="note"><b>Supply status.</b> {{ classification_summary.supply_status }}</div></main></section>

<section class="page">{{ chrome(7) }}<main class="content"><div class="kicker">Part 3 · Response and closure</div><h2>Corrective and preventive action commitments</h2><table class="capa"><thead><tr><th>Committed action</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th><th>Effectiveness evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in capa_plan %}<tr><td>{{ item.action }}</td><td>{{ item.owner }}</td><td>{{ item.due | date_short }}</td><td>{{ item.verification }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><div class="note"><b>Closure condition.</b> Submission of a plan does not close a deficiency. Caldova Global Supplier Quality will verify implementation and effectiveness before changing conditional supply status.</div><h3 style="margin-top:20px">Attachments</h3><table><thead><tr><th style="width:16%">ID</th><th>Title</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in attachments %}<tr><td>{{ item.id }}</td><td>{{ item.title }}</td><td>{{ item.source }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><div class="signatures">{% for item in signatures %}<div class="signature"><b>{{ item.name }}</b><span>{{ item.role }}</span><br><span>Date: {{ item.date | date_en }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div></main></section>

<section class="page">{{ chrome(8) }}<main class="content"><div class="attachment-title"><div><div class="attachment-id">ATTACHMENT A · FIGURE 1</div><h1>BR-04 facility, control, and contamination-risk map</h1></div></div><p>Inspector reconstruction from batch records, maintenance evidence, microbiology results, interviews, and piping walkdown. Spatial arrangement and support-room adjacency are synthetic, schematic, and not to scale.</p>
<svg class="facility-map" viewBox="0 0 690 590" role="img" aria-label="Complex facility and contamination risk map for BluePeak BR-04">
